          "attribute": "question/problem",
          "value": "A circular oil spillage is being cleaned up by a team using specialized cleaning equipment. If the area of the circle is *decreasing* at a rate of $6\\pi\\,\\text{m}^2/\\text{h}$, what is the rate at which the radius is decreasing at the instant when the radius is $2\\,\\text{m}?$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14065925/assets/d769569ed7854f4d6eb085853b51eb0e5aab0e14cfc3bcdf1e5a480d996ccc9e.png)",
