          "attribute": "question/problem",
          "value": "Air is leaking from a spherical balloon at the rate of $500\\pi\\,\\text{cm}^3/\\text{s}.$ How fast is the radius of the balloon decreasing when the radius is $10\\,\\text{cm}?$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14065925/assets/460fd4059be2c655e01b89db2738225a50578b5c76bbe048f83312f0bff655ec.png)",
